New in mi v1.7.5: &quot;--sandbox&quot; runs the agent inside Docker with your current directory mounted, to contain the blast radious in case of unexpected attacks.<p>mi Works with any OpenAI-compatible model (including local ones). Has REPL, skills, and recursive agents and only 30 lines of code, optimised for local models.<p>---
mi --sandbox -p &#x27;fix tests until all are passing&#x27;
